{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>I will cause all My goodness to pass over your face.</b> Meaning: all good attributes with which I bestow benefit upon My creatures. And its saying <b>over your face</b> means: the reason you grasp this matter from Me is ״over your face״ — meaning, the face that you show in the intensity of your extraordinary love and longing for Me, as I explained in the verse ״face to face״ (Exodus 33:11)." "<b>And I will proclaim, etc.</b> Meaning: I will pass My attributes before you and proclaim each one by its name in your presence. Or perhaps each attribute will be called by its name and all of them will be called by the name of YHWH, blessed be He, and there is no greater revelation than this — that through hearing with the ear he recognized all His attributes, blessed be He, each one called in his ears." "And its saying <b>and I will be gracious, etc.</b> — He informed him that that hour is an hour of mercy and grace to ask one's desires of Him."], :book :exodus, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:36:29.644092784Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}